<title>POLAND: Poligrafia soars 153 pct on bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Poligrafia soars 153 pct on bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish printing house Poligrafia SA started bourse trade on the parallel market of the Warsaw exchange at 19 zlotys, 153.3 percent higher than its 7.5-zloty issue price.</p>
<p>The company sold 1,357,280 shares in its November initial public offering, on a first-come-first-served basis.</p>
<p>Poligrafia estimated its 1996 net profit at two million zlotys and forecast it would rise to 2.8 million zlotys in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
